@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
# Local execution and Docker Compose both default to port 5080; adjust for an API_PORT override.
# Use a disposable demo catalog. Before PATCH requests, copy product 1's description
# from the lookup below into this variable as JSON, including quotes/escapes or null.
# The placeholder intentionally prevents a restore until the original value is captured.
@originalDescriptionJson = <paste-original-description-as-JSON>

### Full catalog: 200 OK, one JSON array, all 23 demo products (GUID suffixes 000000000001 through 000000000017)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Accept: application/json

### v1 does not apply pagination: still all 23 demo products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Liveness: 200 OK, text body Healthy
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Generated OpenAPI (Development only): 200 OK, JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Swagger UI (Development only): redirect or 200 OK, HTML
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger

### Unknown route: 404, application/problem+json, traceId
GET {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist
Accept: application/problem+json

### Product lookup: 200; capture description as JSON in originalDescriptionJson before editing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Missing product: 404, problem details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Accept: application/problem+json

### Invalid product ID: 400, validation problem
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/problem+json

### Malformed product ID: 400 from HTTP model binding
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/abc
Accept: application/problem+json

### Product 3: 200; a fresh seed has a storage-labelled description
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
Accept: application/json

### Last demo product: 200, price 235.75
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000017
Accept: application/json

### Numeric IDs are invalid after the GUID upgrade: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1
Accept: application/problem+json

### Update description: 204 No Content, only description changes
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Updated description"}

### Read after update: 200, updated description and unchanged remaining fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Clear description: 204 No Content; a following GET has description: null
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":null}

### Read after clear: 200, description is null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Missing product: 404 ProblemDetails
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Updated description"}

### Missing description: 400 ValidationProblemDetails
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Duplicate description: 400 ValidationProblemDetails, no change
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"First","description":"Second"}

### Unknown field: 400 ValidationProblemDetails, no change
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Updated description","price":0}

### Unsupported media type: 415 ProblemDetails
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: text/plain

Updated description

### Empty description is preserved: 204 No Content
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":""}

### Whitespace is preserved: 204 No Content
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"   "}

### Wrong value type: 400 ValidationProblemDetails
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":123}

### Null body: 400 ValidationProblemDetails
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

null

### Empty GUID: 400 ValidationProblemDetails
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Manual review"}

### Restore product 1's captured description: 204 (set originalDescriptionJson first)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":{{originalDescriptionJson}}}

### Read after restore: 200, description matches the value captured before editing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### v2 defaults: 10 products, page 1, pageSize 10, hasNext true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/products

### v2 second page: 10 products, hasNext true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/products?page=2&pageSize=10

### v2 third page: 3 products, hasNext false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/products?page=3&pageSize=10

### v2 beyond the end: empty items, hasNext false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/products?page=4&pageSize=10

### Invalid pagination: 400 ValidationProblemDetails with traceId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/products?page=0&pageSize=101

### Unsupported offset: 400 ValidationProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/products?page=2147483647&pageSize=100

### Separate v2 OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v2.json
